OL,3,AToby Jones stars in film about UK Mars
OL,4,Amission
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple began developing the
OL,7,Funmanned Beagle 2 probe to search for
OL,8,Flife on Mars while Pillinger was a
OL,9,Fprofessor of planetary sciences at the
OL,10,FOpen University in Milton Keynes. The
OL,11,Fprobe went out of contact upon landing
OL,12,Fin December 2003, until it was finally
OL,13,Fspotted in 2015, after Pillinger died.
OL,15,FCrook said: "It's a complete honour to
OL,16,Fbe telling the extraordinary story...
OL,17,Ffor my first feature film as director."
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
